msgid ""
"MRW will only support the last two versions of the plug-in. It is the "
"client's responsibility to keep the plug-in updated to one of these two "
"versions. MRW will ensure that the plug-in is kept up to date and notify the "
"client of any potential vulnerability in it. It is the client's "
"responsibility, as the data controller and owner of its information systems, "
"to ensure the appropriate security and privacy of its data."
msgstr ""
"MRW solo dará soporte en las dos últimas versiones del plug-in. Es "
"responsabilidad del cliente mantener el plug-in actualizado a una de esas "
"dos versiones. MRW velará para mantener actualizado el plug-in y notificar "
"al cliente cualquier posible vulnerabilidad del mismo. Es responsabilidad "
"del cliente, como responsable del tratamiento de los datos y titular de sus "
"sistemas de información, velar por la adecuada seguridad y privacidad de los "
"mismos."

